    "date": "2026-11-26",
    "kind": "Component sync",
    "summary": "CPRMV moves to GitHub without a new version: production runs 8f01b2b and still reports 0.4.3, built and deployed by GitHub Actions to one VM per tier, each pulling the head of its branch, rolling back a release that fails its check and reporting what runs on /health; acc and main change only through pull requests that pass audit, scan, test and build.",
    "previous": {
      "date": "2026-11-24",
      "kind": "Component sync",
      "summary": "CPRMV v0.4.3, in production: a RuleSet is now an FRBR Endeavor and methods come in modules; the API reads organisations, norms and DSO decision models as sources, returns the original publication through /raw, narrows /methods to one method, drops the EU CELLAR helpers and serves its MCP server at /mcp/; the specification gains new introductory chapters, a diagram per class and a PDF."
